{"id":"629859","name":"鸡翅包饭","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/629859/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡翅","amount":"7个"},{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"1碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"香肠","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡翅去骨，用剪刀伸进去剪开里面连接的部分，抽出骨头。","img":"images/629859/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加生抽、料酒、蚝油、胡椒粉、盐拌匀腌一会。","img":"images/629859/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜、香肠切丁，葱切碎。","img":"images/629859/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油热下入搅好的鸡蛋炒碎。","img":"images/629859/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入胡萝卜碎、葱、香肠碎炒匀。","img":"images/629859/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加生抽、花椒粉炒匀。","img":"images/629859/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下米饭炒好。","img":"images/629859/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"米饭塞入鸡翅。","img":"images/629859/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入空气炸锅。","img":"images/629859/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"℃烤20分钟左右。","img":"images/629859/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤好了。","img":"images/629859/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629859/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}